{"id":1016024,"imdb":"tt33086020","en":"Son of Revenge – The Story of Kalevala","orig":"Kalevala: Kullervon tarina","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"Karelia in the 11th century. A brutal feud between Kalervo and Untamo leads to the massacre of an entire village. The sole survivor is Kalervo's son, Kullervo, whom Untamo decides to raise as his own. As he grows, Kullervo's immense strength and rebellious nature make him feared by those around him. When he learns the truth about his past, his path becomes clear: revenge. His journey takes him across a harsh and treacherous land and into the hands of slave traders, only to uncover a devastating secret that will change his fate forever.","rd":"2026-01-16","rt":143,"g":[18,28],"lang":"fi","budget":5221000,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Finland Storm Inc.","logo":null,"c":"FI"},{"n":"ReelMedia","logo":"/p4NBB0BmRS2bLxj9ruyOVqRwcn3.png","c":"FI"}],"countries":["FI"],"langs":["Finnish"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"FI","d":"2026-01-16"}],"dir":["Antti J. Jokinen"],"prod":["Antti J. Jokinen","Johanna Enäsuo","Marko Röhr"],"wri":["Elias Lönnrot","Antti J. Jokinen","Jorma Tommila"],"mus":["Lauri Porra"],"dop":["Rauno Ronkainen"],"cast":[{"n":"Elias Salonen","ch":"Kullervo","p":"/AdX1T5Y2tuAbsNogAdB8G202ZCC.jpg"},{"n":"Eero Aho","ch":"Untamo","p":"/atAIIq3bG80aQ6zgKu3Lxp7fQcU.jpg"},{"n":"Ilkka Koivula","ch":"Wäinö","p":"/q6BYdDcF8uKGiySR7icBcfn9FtW.jpg"},{"n":"Ronja Orasta","ch":"Aino","p":"/4QiwD4NXpp2A2ae45IR2NYhSFV0.jpg"},{"n":"Olli Rahkonen","ch":"Ilmarinen","p":"/khhtNZAdFP21IhdiZ4wfh5HSfsG.jpg"},{"n":"Krista Kosonen","ch":"Kerttu","p":"/7iW2mxbxBgV5sX2y0fSY78lewW4.jpg"},{"n":"Johannes Holopainen","ch":"Kalervo","p":"/qOa6ryWVJAloqRPx5LLzThlqmwM.jpg"},{"n":"Janne Hyytiäinen","ch":"Kalevi","p":"/AnM4cw1RntFvCVLzDr0MHE8Xdmt.jpg"},{"n":"Seela Sella","ch":"Muori","p":"/oTEtOUcNpzc0y2wSb6FoHtKdyDe.jpg"},{"n":"Jesse Gyllenbögel","ch":"Sampo","p":null},{"n":"Julius Susimäki","ch":"Tiera","p":null},{"n":"Jaakko Ohtonen","ch":"Sampsa","p":"/ce